---
import { navigation } from '../data/navigation';

const mainNav = navigation.slice(0, 4);
const secondaryNav = navigation.slice(4);
---

<footer class="relative mt-16 overflow-hidden border-t border-red-500/20 bg-black py-12 text-slate-400">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-red-500/60 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Main Footer Content -->
    <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 mb-10">
      <!-- Brand Section -->
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="text-lg font-bold text-white hover:text-red-400 transition-colors">
          ♠ 百家樂攻略誌
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
          以規則、機率與風險意識為基礎，提供系統化的百家樂教育內容與分析工具。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Primary Navigation -->
      <nav aria-label="主要頁面">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-3 text-sm">快速入門</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          {mainNav.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a class="text-sm hover:text-red-400 transition-colors" href={item.href}>
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <!-- Secondary Navigation -->
      <nav aria-label="更多內容">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-3 text-sm">知識中心</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          {secondaryNav.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a class="text-sm hover:text-red-400 transition-colors" href={item.href}>
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <!-- Additional Links -->
      <nav aria-label="其他連結">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-3 text-sm">相關資源</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a class="text-sm hover:text-red-400 transition-colors" href="/">首頁</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="text-sm hover:text-red-400 transition-colors" href="/faq/">常見問題</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="text-sm hover:text-red-400 transition-colors" href="#contact">聯絡我們</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Section -->
    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-6">
        <strong>免責聲明：</strong>本網站提供的所有內容僅供教育、娛樂與參考之用，不構成任何投資建議或保證。百家樂是機運遊戲，任何策略都無法改變個別牌局的結果。請理性遊戲、負責任消費。
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} 百家樂攻略誌。保留所有權利。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
